# Sample custom Break-the-Targets layout for Mario (character 8).
# Phase 1: reuses Mario's vanilla Target Test stage geometry (GrTMr.dat);
# only the targets move. Coordinates are world/console stage units
# (X right, Y up, Z depth).
# Phase 2: `platform <cx> <cy> <cz> <w> <d>` adds a floating platform with its
# top surface at cy, X extent w and Z depth d (drop-through, stand-on).
name Mario 3-target sample
character mario
target 0 30 0
target 45 60 0
target -45 60 0
platform 0 40 0 60 40
platform -50 70 0 50 30
